// Coverage gap, not necessarily a crash: this fires whether nobody has run
// `npm run score` in a while, or a real recompute genuinely failed partway.
// Throwing marks the execution red in the Executions list either way, which
// is the point -- workflow 03 should not read scores in this state.
throw new Error(
  `Only ${$json.scored} customers have a computed score, expected ~800. Run 'npm run score' to refresh them.`
);
